From: Bench Fixture <bench@example.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:26:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add REST views to read and switch maintenance

GET /projects/{name}/demo-plugin~maintenance reports the state to
anyone who can see the project. PUT switches maintenance on and DELETE
switches it off; both require the demo-plugin-maintain capability.

Ping does not look at the state yet.
